    "senderName": "Megan",
    "imageUrl": "https://files.38degrees.org.uk/items/files/000/010/612/display/Sky%20ITV%20Takeover%20v1.png",
    "imageAltText": "An image of a remote being held up in front of a TV with the words lisa nandy stop skys itv takeover over it",
    "petitionHtml": "<h2><strong>Petition text</strong></h2><div class=\"card card-body\">Block the Sky takeover of ITV. The public wants you to protect the range of voices in the UK media. This deal cannot go ahead.</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Why is this important?</strong></div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Sky, owned by US media giant Comcast, wants to take over ITV. It would mean fewer and fewer voices reporting on the news here in the UK - as it would mean 86% of the UK news market being controlled by either the BBC or Sky. And it </span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">could </em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">pave the way for an end to ITV being free to watch here in the UK when its current licence ends in 2034.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">We cannot allow more of our media landscape to become part of a monopoly controlled by a huge US company.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">Culture Secretary Lisa Nandy has said she&#39;s thinking about intervening in the deal. But you can bet she&#39;ll be up against the lobbyists of this giant company, who&#39;ll be pressuring her and other politicians that the takeover should go ahead. </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">This whole situation is moving fast, so we need to move faster if we&#39;re going to drown them out and tell Lisa Nandy the public wants her to step in and protect our media. </span></p><div><br></div>",
    "collectedAt": "2026-10-24T14:00:41.363631+00:00"
   },
